{"content":"{\"chapter_contract_id\":\"contract:v2-n-3-1-2-1:v2\",\"node_id\":\"v2_n_3_1_2_1\",\"schema_version\":\"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\"known_evidence_ids\":[],\"blocks\":[{\"block_id\":\"blk:v2_n_3_1_2_1:p1\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"目标人群（估计目标属性一）应为成人慢性鼻窦炎伴鼻息肉患者；试验参与者允许使用稳定的背景鼻用糖皮质激素，并应记录其使用情况。\",\"evidence_refs\":[]},{\"block_id\":\"blk:v2_n_3_1_2_1:p2\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"目标人群不应默认等同于随机后分析集或“至少一次给药”人群，应明确说明其与主要分析集的区别与关系。本研究中主要分析集为全分析集（FAS），遵循意向性治疗（ITT）原则，包括随机化试验参与者，按随机分组进行分析，主要分析应基于FAS；FAS用于主要分析，而目标人群是估计目标所针对的临床人群定义。\",\"evidence_refs\":[]}]}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"fc844f5ac3db0bfa906ff4e5488a010a90c447f1cf0c3415965f5afff3720182"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:68cc2b286ff0c2d9081f4884d10c8238895e3cd8f4e60bbaff0676e2da88d12f:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:68cc2b286ff0c2d9081f4884d10c8238895e3cd8f4e60bbaff0676e2da88d12f:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"3e937d794195c89e588106b0cee6962727ec402aba695e3b8c8679418486489a","prompt_sha256":"9aec0ea7a8d8361fdb1c273790e20e30d5e6b1d7680ac1c6c63436bd71300fac","provider_session_id":"42d3a434-1c06-4907-94aa-316f42e3a1cd","requested_reasoning_effort":"max"},"schema":"model_response.v1"}